rn. Delicious braised oranges with bitter kumis is served here."},{"id":"marker9","name":"The Orange Wolverine","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious fried lamb with green whisky is served here."},{"id":"marker10","name":"The Dark Snake","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious boiled snake with shiny juice is served here."},{"id":"marker11","name":"Dusontiacum Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker12","name":"Histheberan Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker13","name":"Slutstiylan Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker14","name":"Vitatean Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker15","name":"Chio Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker16","name":"Trilelan Waterfall","legend":"The cascades of a stunning waterfall."},{"id":"marker17","name":"Arnapoli Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Hinolisan Conflict. \r\nDate: March 20, 513 Leighel Era."},{"id":"marker18","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=1700049832533\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=1700049832533\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker19","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=1700049833455\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=1700049833455\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker20","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=1700049834116\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=1700049834116\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker21","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=1700049831041\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=1700049831041\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker22","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=1700049833122\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=1700049833122\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker23","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=1700049833189\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=1700049833189\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker24","name":"Tihulces Monster","legend":"Journeying folk say a relic monster of 10 m long inhabits Tihulces Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker25","name":"Padstable Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 18 m long."},{"id":"marker26","name":"Lympsham Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 30 m long."},{"id":"marker27","name":"Serapome Mountain","legend":"A sacred mountain of No religion. Height: 2704m."},{"id":"marker28","name":"Myrgytos Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Old Elladan Druidism."},{"id":"marker29","name":"Kolta Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Deities of the Lost Hyena."},{"id":"marker30","name":"Varvinen Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Deities of the Lost Hyena."},{"id":"marker31","name":"Allos Apes","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker32","name":"Alhos Foxes","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker33","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker34","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker35","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker36","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker37","name":"Lefkamealia Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡕᢟᡮᠮᡀᡍᠽᠽᡞ᠒ᠧᢋᠲᡜᡜᠲᡒᠩᠱᡙᢡᡀᠲ᠀ᢁᡓᡰᢥᡟᡐᡰᡡᢟ᠐ᡳᡞᠽᡴᠾᢛᡡᢠᡜᢦᡴ᠐᠐ᡏᡎᡭᡗᠦᢜ᠑ᢟᠾᡔ</div>"},{"id":"marker38","name":"Broney Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༿༬༌༑༢༡༫༰༵༐༿༆༰༾ༀ༡༔་༳༼༥༌༸༨༕ༀ༊༶༕ༀༀ༣༵༠༘༙༐༲༽༺༳༯༹༙༕༮༺་༁༔༮༰༱༅༌༾༰ༀ༙༤༧༉༦༾༸༗༔༚༊༸༗༴༺ༀ༻༌༮༻༖༷༨༮༇༷༭༹༷༲༠༺༶༅ༀ</div>"},{"id":"marker39","name":"Lincum Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡏᡯᡎᢐᡴᢢᠭᡞᠲᠯᠪᡐᡐᠻᡁᡖ᠀ᠩ᠐ᡮᢋᠭᡠᡎᡴᡓᢠᡟᢛ᠒ᠪᡙᢟᡯᢐᠲᡜᡕᡴᢡᠪᢑᢢᡲᢠᡏᠮᠻᡍᠪᡞᡐᢦᡁᢡᡙᠯᡴ᠒ᠩᢒᡔᠱᡎᡡᡎᡏᢞᡓᢋᠻᢜᠯᠮᡐᡁᠰᡟᡔᠠᠰᡒᡡ᠀ᡠᡁᠠᢤᡓᡳᠪ</div>"},{"id":"marker40","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker41","name":"Ruined Outpost","legend":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker42","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker43","name":"Stenetsk Library","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker44","name":"Travelling Extraordinary Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this extraordinary circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker45","name":"Travelling Unmissable Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this unmissable circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker46","name":"Cambanola Tournament","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a tournament of cunning in Cambanola, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"id":"marker47","name":"Tausondaura Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Tausondaura, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker48","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Dekion River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker49","name":"Wolves migration","legend":"A huge group of wolves are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker50","name":"Hatfordbury Cemetery","legend":"This ethereal necropolis seems suspended between the realms of the living and the dead. Wisps of mist dance around the tombstones, while haunting melodies linger in the air, commemorating the departed."},{"id":"marker51","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/4539\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker52","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1427\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker53","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1258\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker54","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/3429\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker55","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1319\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker56","name":"The Party","legend":"Current location of the adventuring party."}]
